<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>Description: ONE TIME, after installing S03. Runs the new lock rules over every unlocked note, so notes that were stuck only because the supervisor had not signed (or canceled notes with just an EI signature) lock now instead of on their next save.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>Run it once as an admin, on the server copy, then leave it disabled. Safe to re-run: Seal If Complete ignores notes that are not ready.</Text></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/></Step>
<Step enable="True" id="86" name="Set Error Capture"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Set state="True"/></Step>
